{"articleNo":"144636","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=144636&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2016 KGSP Admission Call for Graduate School","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2016.02.02","hit":"2966","attachments":[{"name":"2016 KGSP-G Application Forms.docx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=144636&attachNo=74197"},{"name":"2016 대학원장학생 선발관련 FAQ (English-Korean).pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=144636&attachNo=74244"},{"name":"2016 KGSP-G Application Guidelines (Korean).pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=144636&attachNo=74283"},{"name":"2016 KGSP-G Application Guidelines (English).pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=144636&attachNo=74335"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p></p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt;\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 107%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; font-size: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 13.0pt;\"><font color=\"#000000\">2016 KGSP Admission Call for Graduate SchoolStudying at kit, Korea</font></span></b></p><p></p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 107%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; font-size: 13pt;\"><font color=\"#000000\">We are pleased to inform you of 2016KGSP(Korean Government Scholarship Program) Guideline for Master’s or Doctoralcandidates here in Korea. </font></span></p><p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"굴림\" size=\"3\"><br></font></p><p></p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt;\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 107%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; font-size: 13pt;\">As the only national engineeringspecialized university in Korea, we will be able to nominate quite a few candidates.</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 107%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-style: italic;\">This might be a great opportunity for you to beable to study in Korea with a government full scholarship. </span></font></p><p></p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt;\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 107%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-style: italic;\">Please see attached forfurther information and if there are any candidates interested in this program,please send me one original application form </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 107%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; font-size: 13pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans-Bold; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">no later than March 25<sup>th</sup> (Friday) 2016.</span></font></p><p></p><p align=\"left\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; text-align: left; line-height: normal; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-layout-grid-align: none;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-style: italic;\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;</font></span></p><p></p><p align=\"left\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; text-align: left; line-height: normal; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-layout-grid-align: none;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-style: italic;\"><font color=\"#000000\">1. Applicants' GPA must be more than 2.64 on a 4.0 scale, 2.80 on a 4.3scale, 2.91 on a 4.5 scale, or grades/marks/score of 80% from your university.</font></span></p><p></p><p align=\"left\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; text-align: left; line-height: normal; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-layout-grid-align: none;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; font-size: 13pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;</font></span></b></p><p></p><p align=\"left\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; text-align: left; line-height: normal; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-layout-grid-align: none;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: black; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-style: italic;\">2. Applicants who submit applications to more than two designatedinstitutions will be disqualified.</span></p><p></p><p align=\"left\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; text-align: left; line-height: normal; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-layout-grid-align: none;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: black; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-style: italic;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p></p><p align=\"left\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; text-align: left; line-height: normal; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-layout-grid-align: none;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: black; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-style: italic;\">3. Scholarship duration: Master's(1 yr. of Korean Language + 2 yrs. ofMaster'), Doctoral(1 yr. of Korean Language + 3 yrs. of Doctoral)</span></p><p></p><p align=\"left\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; text-align: left; line-height: normal; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-layout-grid-align: none;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: black; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-style: italic;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p></p><p align=\"left\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; text-align: left; line-height: normal; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-layout-grid-align: none;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: black; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-style: italic;\">4. Applicants must be under 40 years of age as of Sep.1st, 2016(bornafter Sep. 1, 1976).</span></p><p></p><p align=\"left\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; text-align: left; line-height: normal; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-layout-grid-align: none;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: black; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-style: italic;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p></p><p align=\"left\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; text-align: left; line-height: normal; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-layout-grid-align: none;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: black; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-style: italic;\">All required documents must be written by computer typing and send usone original document by post only (no e-mail application will be accepted).</span></p><p></p><p align=\"left\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; text-align: left; line-height: normal; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-layout-grid-align: none;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: black; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-style: italic;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p></p><p align=\"left\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; text-align: left; line-height: normal; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-layout-grid-align: none;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: black; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; font-size: 13pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans-Bold; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">For further information, please see attached orvisit website(<a href=\"http://eng.kumoh.ac.kr/\"><u><font color=\"#0563c1\">http://eng.kumoh.ac.kr</font></u></a>).</span></p><p></p><p align=\"left\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; text-align: left; line-height: normal; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-layout-grid-align: none;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: black; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans-Bold; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p></p><p align=\"left\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; text-align: left; line-height: normal; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-layout-grid-align: none;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: red; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans-Bold; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">Submission Deadline</span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: black; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans-Bold; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\"> : 25 March 2016</span></b></p><p></p><p align=\"left\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; text-align: left; line-height: normal; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-layout-grid-align: none;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: black; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans-Bold; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p></p><p align=\"left\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; text-align: left; line-height: normal; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-layout-grid-align: none;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: red; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast